THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-DOCKER
==========================

Attribution for the Docker client components the `build-runner` image
redistributes: the Docker CLI, and the buildx and compose CLI plugins. All three
are copied out of the docker-library `docker:<N>-cli` image, whose exact tag and
digest are pinned in the `build-runner` stage of the root Dockerfile. A
`COPY --from` takes only the named paths, so any attribution that image carried
does not travel with them; this file is it.

This is NOT covered by THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES, which is generated from the
committed vendor/ tree and so scopes to the Go modules statically linked into
this project's own binaries. Update this file by hand when the pinned
docker:<N>-cli major moves and a component's license or notice changes.

Components, all licensed Apache-2.0 (the same license as this project; its full
text ships beside this file at /licenses/LICENSE):

  Docker CLI       https://github.com/docker/cli
  Docker buildx    https://github.com/docker/buildx     (ships no NOTICE file)
  Docker compose   https://github.com/docker/compose

